Support Division: 55 Multi-functional Snow Detector","comfort":140},{"name":"Curtain Lamp","id":"furni_tradeLounge_ceilinglamp_01","obtain":"Event missions","comfort":165},{"name":"Karlan Trade Office Chair","id":"furni_tradeLounge_deckChair_01","obtain":"Purchased from the Limited Furniture Store","comfort":190},{"name":"Karlan Ritual Pillar","id":"furni_tradeLounge_column_01","obtain":"Event missions","comfort":190},{"name":"Stone Shelf","id":"furni_tradeLounge_statueBox_01","obtain":"Event missions","comfort":105},{"name":"Small Recliner","id":"furni_tradeLounge_chair_01","obtain":"Event missions","comfort":135},{"name":"Stone Announcement Board","id":"furni_tradeLounge_shelf_01","obtain":"Event missions","comfort":140},{"name":"Karlan Trade Wallpaper","id":"furni_tradeLounge_wallpaper_01","obtain":"Observatory Support Division: 75 Multi-functional Snow Detector","comfort":225},{"name":"Kjerag Stone Floor","id":"furni_tradeLounge_floor_01","obtain":"Observatory Support Division: 75 Multi-functional Snow Detector","comfort":225}]}],"notices":[],"news":[{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] SPECIAL RECRUITMENT OPEN","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["DURATION: April 14, 2026, 08:00 – May 18, 2026, 03:59 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: During the event, Job Tags that include the corresponding tags are guaranteed when refreshing. Top Operator tag is guaranteed to appear during the event (once only). By completing the Special Recruitment with the Top Operator tag in this period, you can obtain one 6★ Operator (limited to Operators available from Recruit).","Note:","- When the Top Operator tag is chosen and the Recruit time is set to 9 hours, a 6-star Operator is guaranteed."]},{"title":"2 026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] MOUNT KARLAN WISHING WALL OPEN","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["DURATION: April 14, 2026, 08:00 - April 28, 2026, 03:59 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: During the event, players can get two trials for Wishing Tickets after daily login. Consume trials to participate in [Mount Karlan Wishing Wall]. The Wishing Tickets with the most Orundum will be awarded. Both trials for the day must be used before claiming the reward.","NOTE:","- There are 14 days at most for players to pick Wishing Tickets.","- Players will randomly obtain the following amount of Orundum from Wishing Tickets:","Orundum * 200, Orundum * 300, Orundum * 400, Orundum * 500, Orundum * 600, Orundum * 800","- If the amount of Orundum in daily reward is less than 400 (400 is NOT included), players will be granted an extra trial the next day. The extra trial cannot be accumulated, players can get 3 daily trials at most (including the extra trial).","- All the daily trials will be refreshed at 4:00 am (UTC-7) on the next day and cannot be accumulated."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] OPERATORS UPDATE IN PURCHASE CERTIFICATES STORE","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["UPDATE TIME: April 14, 2026, 08:00 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: The following Operators will be added to the Purchase Certificates Store.","★★★★★: Hadiya","★★★★: Akkord New Operators Hadiya and Akkord can be redeemed at the Purchase Certificates Store. Operator Hadiya and Akkord are NOT available in any Standard Headhunting or Recruit."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] NEW OPERATORS NOW AVAILABLE","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["DETAILS: The following Operators will be added to the game.","★★★★★★: SilverAsh the Reignfrost [Limited]","★★★★★★: Pramanix the Prerita","★★★★★★: Astgenne the Lightchaser","★★★★★: Snow Hunter","★★★★★: Hadiya","★★★★: Akkord","DETAILS:","- SilverAsh the Reignfrost is currently ONLY available from the [Limited Headhunting - Celebration], and is NOT available in any Standard Headhunting.","- Operator Astgenne the Lightchaser is currently ONLY available to be obtained from event Retracing Our Steps, and is NOT available in any Standard Headhunting or Recruit.","- After the [A Shared Oath of Guardianship] banner ends, [Pramanix the Prerita] and [Snow Hunter] will become available in other [Standard Headhuntings] after April 28, 2026, 04:00 (UTC-7).","- Operator Hadiya and Akkord can be redeemed at the Purchase Certificates Store, and are NOT available in any Standard Headhunting or Recruit.","- Operator SilverAsh the Reignfrost, Pramanix the Prerita, Astgenne the Lightchaser, and Snow Hunter will gain more trust in the event stages during April 14, 2026, 08:00 - May 5, 2026, 03:59 (UTC-7)."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] OPTIMIZATION TO SANITY POTION USAGE","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["UPDATE TIME: April 14, 2026, 08:00 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: After the update, all types of Sanity Potions will be used automatically upon expiry (The Sanity gained from using potions cannot exceed the upper limit of 999)."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] OPTIMIZATIONS TO CLUES & SUPPORT FUNCTIONS","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["UPDATE TIME: May 21, 2026, 08:00 (UTC-7)","DETAILS:","- After the Clues Feature update, the Reception Room will add [Quick Place] and [Quickly give duplicate clues] functions. Quick Place allows you to conveniently place owned clues into the corresponding slots, prioritizing those closest to expiration; [Quickly give duplicate clues] allows you to send duplicate clues you hold to friends who are missing the corresponding clues in one go.","- After the Support Function improvements, players can borrow Support Operators according to their original proficiencies level (including level, Modules, and Specialize skill), no longer affected by the highest-level Operator in the squad or whether the player is on the friend list."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] SPECIALIZED MODULES UPDATE","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["UPDATE TIME: April 14, 2026, 08:00 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: Specialized Modules will be available, effective in certain game modes.","Operators with Specialized Modules in current update: Ho'olheyak, Gnosis. Their Specialized Modules can take effect in [Integrated Strategies].","NOTE:","There are no unlock missions for Specialized Modules, and the materials needed for unlocking and upgrading them are significantly reduced compared to regular modules."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] NEW REDEEMABLE AVAILABLE IN [DISTINCTIONS] AND [UNIVERSAL CERTIFICATES EXCHANGE AREA]","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["UPDATE TIME: April 14, 2026, 08:00 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: New redeemable in [Distinctions] and [Universal Certificates Exchange Area]:","Witch Feast Series - Imp's House for Rope"]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] RECRUIT OPERATORS UPDATE","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["UPDATE TIME: April 14, 2026, 08:00 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: After the update, the following Operators will be permanently added to Recruit.","★★★★★★ Kal'tsit","★★★★★ Akafuyu","NOTE:","During the update, tags that have not yet been used for recruit will be refreshed. Please stay tuned for further information."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] THEMED BACKGROUND RERUN","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["DURATION: April 14, 2026, 08:00 - May 12, 2026, 03:59 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: During the event, players can log in to the game to unlock the new Themed Background 'Celebration'. The Themed Background can be viewed and changed on the main menu."]},{"title":"2026 [THANK-YOU CELEBRATION] KERNEL LOCATING OPEN","source":"https://www.arknights.global/news/2926","published":"2026-04-10T02:50:00.191Z","lines":["DURATION: April 21, 2026, 04:00 – May 5, 2026, 03:59 (UTC-7)","DETAILS: During the Kernel Locating, you can pick and lock-in two 6-star Operators and three 5-star Operators as the rated-up Operators for the current banner. Correspondingly, the redeemable Operators in [Distinctions] and [Universal Certificates Exchange Area] will be shifted into: A 6-star and a 5-star Operator of your choice from the rated-up Operators for the current banner.","All possible Operators:","★★★★★★ (2%): Carnelian / Pallas / Mudrock / Mountain / Saga / Flametail / Passenger / Eunectes / Archetto / Blaze / Saria / Exusiai","★★★★★ (8%): La Pluma / Mulberry / Warfarin / GreyThroat / Elysium / Liskarm / Sesa / Manticore / Skyfire / Cliffheart / Executor / Sora / Reed / Mayer / Croissant / Waai Fu / Iris / Leizi / Nightmare / Meteorite / Leonhardt / Toddifons / Chiave / Pramanix","Note: The odds of getting a 6-star Operator due to accumulated rolls in the [Kernel Headhunting] before the shift WILL carry to the [Kernel Locating] banner."]}]},"loginDetails":{"Thank-You Celebration Limited-Time Sign-In":{"description":null,"days":[[{"name":"Emergency Sanity Concentrate","count":1,"iconPath":"/material-icons/Emergency Sanity Concentrate.webp"},{"name":"Expedited Plan","count":5,"iconPath":"/material-icons/Expedited Plan.webp"}],[{"name":"Orundum","count":200,"iconPath":"/material-icons/Orundum.webp"},{"name":"Recruitment Permit","count":5,"iconPath":"/material-icons/Recruitment Permit.webp"}],[{"name":"Statue in Storm","count":1,"iconPath":"/material-icons/furni_act67d0_frostEffigy_01.webp"},{"name":"Skill Summary - 1","count":30,"iconPath":"/material-icons/Skill Summary - 1.webp"}],[{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","count":3,"iconPath":"/material-icons/Data Supplement Instrument.webp"},{"name":"LMD","count":30000,"iconPath":"/material-icons/LMD.webp"}],[{"name":"Tactical Battle Record","count":20,"iconPath":"/material-icons/Tactical Battle Record.webp"},{"name"